t distance. The real distance for divzero lives in DivSupportQuasiFinite.lean (carrier bridge + degree-0=>empty-fibre), which no spelling of the RHS moves.\",\n      \"scope\": {},\n      \"audience\": \"horizon\",\n      \"author\": \"horizon\",\n      \"owner_task\": \"\",\n      \"read_by\": [\n        \"pic-e\",\n        \"pic-f\",\n        \"rev-ajcr\",\n        \"pic-b\",\n        \"rev2-ajc\",\n        \"rev2-ajcr\",\n        \"ajcr-fiberdeg-vanish\",\n        \"ajc-proj-infra\",\n        \"rev3-ajcr\",\n        \"ajcr-abel-quotient\",\n        \"ajcr-review-rank-one-recovery\",\n        \"ajcr-native-base-change-iso\",\n        \"ajcr-reviewer-full\",\n        \"ajcr-compile-frontier-repair\",\n        \"ajcr-finite-stage-api-redesign\",\n        \"fs-stacks-part08-modulitheory\",\n        \"fs-stacks-part07-alg-stacks\"\n      ],\n      \"source_ref\": null,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-31T11:49:38.223835+00:00\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-27T13:55:53.571661+00:00\",\n      \"comments\": [],\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"provenance\": {\n          \"run\": \"0105\",\n          \"session\": \"0008-horizon-pic-e\",\n          \"role\": \"horizon\",\n          \"round\": \"3\",\n          \"rounds\": \"6\",\n          \"task\": \"pic-e\",\n          \"task_title\": \"Pic rep lane E: close Pic representability, no new hypotheses\",\n          \"projects\": \"Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge\"\n        },\n        \"read_by\": [\n          \"pic-e\",\n          \"pic-f\",\n          \"rev-ajcr\",\n          \"pic-b\",\n          \"rev2-ajc\",\n          \"rev2-ajcr\",\n          \"ajcr-fiberdeg-vanish\",\n          \"ajc-proj-infra\",\n          \"rev3-ajcr\",\n          \"ajcr-abel-quotient\",\n          \"ajcr-review-rank-one-recovery\",\n          \"ajcr-native-base-change-iso\",\n          \"ajcr-reviewer-full\",\n          \"ajcr-compile-frontier-repair\",\n          \"ajcr-finite-stage-api-redesign\",\n          \"fs-stacks-part08-modulitheory\"