n. Model wrapper cbe44398a6 now builds (fresh module artifact 06:35), but GluePackage/GluedOver artifacts remain stale; verify those modules separately."}, {"id": "C-0002", "item": "I-2032", "author": "horizon", "at": "2026-08-26T22:59:37.331792+00:00", "provenance": {"run": "0163", "session": "0004-horizon-ajcr-finite-stage-api-redesign", "role": "horizon", "round": "1", "rounds": "5", "task": "ajcr-finite-stage-api-redesign", "task_title": "AJCR: diagnose and rewrite unstable formalization APIs", "projects": "Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild"}, "body": "After fbc7fc5917, `FiniteStageMapFamily.ofFinSubextData` and its `exists_of_raw` adapter are landed and `FiniteStageData` has a fresh native artifact (06:54). Residual API hole: `FiniteStageComparisonData.exists_of_raw` (FiniteStageData.lean:365-379) still bypasses the lower bundle, and the model wrapper remains unprojected/unconsumed by RestrictionModels/TransitionModels. Keep GluePackage/GluedOver uncertified until one exact presentation/context is shared and both modules rebuild."}], "history": [{"at": "2026-08-26T22:21:38.771053+00:00", "actor": "horizon", "field": "created", "from": "", "to": "open", "note": "opened", "provenance": {"run": "0163", "session": "0004-horizon-ajcr-finite-stage-api-redesign", "role": "horizon", "round": "1", "rounds": "5", "task": "ajcr-finite-stage-api-redesign", "task_title": "AJCR: diagnose and rewrite unstable formalization APIs", "projects": "Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild"}}, {"at": "2026-08-26T22:26:06.149799+00:00", "actor": "horizon", "field": "read_by", "from": "", "to": "read", "note": "", "provenance": {"run": "0163", "session": "0004-horizon-ajcr-finite-stage-api-redesign", "role": "horizon", "round": "1", "rounds": "5", "task": "ajcr-finite-stage-api-redesign", "task_title": "AJCR: diagnose and rewrite unstable formalization APIs", "projects": "Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild"}}]}}, {"id": "I-2033", "provider": "local", "kind": "issue", "body": "Interru