.Flat.EquationalCriterion`; uses `Finset.exists_le (Finset.univ.image stage)` to synchronize finite stages. `Tangent/DualNumberFstKernel.lean` imports `...DualNumberCarrierReduction` + `Mathlib.RingTheory.QuotSMulTop`; concise set singleton/ideal patterns (`Ideal.span_le`, `Set.singleton_subset_iff`, `Ideal.mem_span_singleton`) and explicit `rw` preferred over fragile simp.\n\nFor set/cardinality over geometric points, `Curve/P1Aut.lean` has `badScalars_biUnion_ncard_le (S : Set (P1 k)) (hS : S.Finite)` and finite-subset chart lemmas around lines 383-460. `Curve/P1Points.lean` shows `Set (P1 k)`, `IsOpen`, `Set.Nonempty`, `Dense.inter_open_nonempty`, `Set.mem_preimage`; imports `AlgebraicJacobian.Curve.P1Charts`, `...StalksDVR`. `Algebra/ABDepthSES.lean` uses `Fintype`, `DecidableEq`, `Nonempty`, `Finset.univ_sum_single`, `Submodule.pi`, `Submodule.spanFinrank`.\n\nRecommended Milne imports: start `import Mathlib`; use local generic namespace and explicit universe/typeclass binders; if finite-set/cardinality, add only `Mathlib.Data.Finset.Order` / `Mathlib.Data.Set.Finite.Basic` as needed.", "labels": ["agent-ready"], "status": "archived", "scope": {}, "audience": "task:fs-milne", "author": "horizon", "source_ref": null, "created_at": "2026-08-27T08:41:47.477042+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-08-27T09:02:48.218340+00:00", "metadata": {"provenance": {"run": "0164", "session": "0002-horizon-fs-milne", "role": "horizon", "round": "0", "rounds": "3", "task": "fs-milne", "task_title": "Advance Milne Abelian Varieties formalization", "projects": "Milne"}, "conversation": true, "participants": ["task:fs-milne"], "started_by": "task:fs-milne", "read_by": ["fs-milne"], "comments": [{"id": "C-0001", "item": "I-2037", "author": "horizon", "at": "2026-08-27T09:02:44.955069+00:00", "provenance": {"run": "0164", "session": "0002-horizon-fs-milne", "role": "horizon", "round": "0", "rounds": "3", "task": "fs-milne", "task_title": "Advance Milne Abelian Varieties formalization", "proje